ack online\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-de91e5966a474d8c\",\"cmd-c7ba5bfb9d7e49b0\",\"cmd-8fa682242f6743f4\"],\"summary\":\"Issued backgrounded `sudo reboot`; acknowledgement returned; subsequent 
